# Secrets. Nothing matching these may ever be committed.
#
# Added 2026-08-03 after a near miss: a deploy step called for putting
# VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET in .env.local, and this file had no env rule at
# all — so the secret would have been staged by the next `git add -A` and pushed
# to a public repo. Nothing leaked (no .env* was ever tracked; `git log -S` across
# all branches is empty), but only because the file had not been created yet.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
